        "original_id": "d9b0602c-73ac-5062-af91-6274f3bc35ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2017 Canadian Olympic Curling Trials\n- Places: Ottawa, Ontario\n- Venues: Canadian Tire Centre\n- Topics: venue naming history\n\nFacts:\n- The Canadian Tire Centre in Ottawa, Ontario, opened in January 1996 as The Palladium.\n- The Canadian Tire Centre was known as Corel Centre from 1996 to 2006.\n- The Canadian Tire Centre was known as Scotiabank Place from 2006 to 2013.\n- The 2017 Canadian Olympic Curling Trials were scheduled to be held from December 2 to 10 at the Canadian Tire Centre in Ottawa, Ontario.",
